  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (decision recorded, no ADR): the dead-code-maybe headline moves to --seeds all with labeled disclosure buckets, which shrinks the downstream false-positive surface this invariant feeds — but it does not fix dispatch-primitive traversal itself. Stays violated until the call-graph traversal gap is closed; the default change only reduces symptom exposure."  # ec63
